# arch-aarch64.pkgs — the Raspberry Pi half.
#
# ⛔ THE KERNEL IS PER MODEL AND THEY ARE NOT INTERCHANGEABLE. Void ships
# rpi-kernel (Pi 3/4) and rpi5-kernel as separate packages; build/config.sh
# picks one. Both models take the generic rpi-base — the rpi4-base and
# rpi4-kernel names are TRANSITIONAL DUMMIES as of 2026-09-06. Guessing here
# produces an
# image that builds cleanly and does not boot.
rpi-firmware
rpi-userland
mesa-dri
xf86-video-fbdev
